    "id": "CW-006",
    "code": "CW-006",
    "title": {
      "en": "Using Leverage and Margin Without Losing Risk Control",
      "zh": "在保持风险控制的前提下使用杠杆与保证金"
    },
    "shortTitle": {
      "en": "leverage",
      "zh": "在保持风险控制的前提下使用杠杆与保证金"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates using leverage and margin without losing risk control using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示在保持风险控制的前提下使用杠杆与保证金。"
    },
    "categoryId": "market_foundations",
